  "material_learning": "DMI14 with ADX14 above 25 was an exceptionally strong Design-period high-low trend state and reduced maximum drawdown in every annual fold, but its economic edge did not generalize to 2023-2024. Validation captured only 30.291985 percent of passive upside and reached 47.554136 percent of passive Calmar. Lowering ADX to 20 increased exposure but worsened Validation drawdown by 9.20641105 percentage points and reached only 19.949608 percent of passive Calmar; raising it to 30 reduced drawdown but captured only 22.795630 percent of upside. Only two of five years captured at least half of passive upside. The family therefore identifies selective historical trend bursts and bear-loss avoidance, not stable independent risk-adjusted alpha.",
